---
title: Notification delivery
---
sequenceDiagram
	participant Finance
	participant Kafka
	participant Notification
	participant SMTP as SMTP provider

	Finance ->> Kafka: Publish order email command
	Kafka ->> Notification: Deliver command

	alt Recipient address is blank
		Notification ->> Notification: Skip email work
	else Recipient address is present
		Notification ->> Notification: Render Orders/OrderEmail via MJML
		Notification ->> SMTP: Submit email via MailKit with resilience pipeline

		alt SMTP submission succeeds
			SMTP -->> Notification: Submission accepted
		else Submission fails after retries
			Notification ->> Kafka: Route to notification dead-letter queue
		end
	end
	Note over Notification,SMTP: Provider acceptance is not inbox delivery
